# ...but stereo_chemical_props.txt is a 9 KB CONSTANTS file that openfold/__init__.py needs
# transitively: without it `import openfold` fails outright on a fresh clone, which cost a
# whole job on a new host (2026-09-02). The exclusion above exists to keep ~10 GB of model
# params out; it should not take the constants with it.
!openfold/resources/stereo_chemical_props.txt
